<title>BERMUDA: Konsortium Bhd approves amalgamation.</title>
<headline>Konsortium Bhd approves amalgamation.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR, Bermuda 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Konsortium Perkapalan Bhd and Pacific Basin Bulk Shipping Ltd said Monday that Konsortium shareholders had approved the amalgamation of Pacific Basin Bulk Shipping.</p>
<p>The shareholders of Pacific Basin approved the amalgamation at a special general meeting held on 6th August.</p>
<p>The companies said the Minister of Finance of Bermuda has granted approval of the amalgamation and Bank Negara Malaysia has approved the remittance of funds outside of Malaysia by KPB in connection with the amalgamation, as contemplated by the Agreement of Amalgamation.</p>
<p>Accordingly, KPB and Pacific Basin have established Tuesday, 17th September for closing.</p>
</text>
